From 00213d0af11b8e41151f6ec4503064937cbb4742 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 05:44:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(3d): Pass starts at on 3D Finish (Contour and Flat)

3D Finish gets the shared pass_start field (#3316) with the same type,
project key (auto never written, no version step), digest writer, page
row and generic MCP door as 3D Pocket. Contour and Flat read it through
the new finishing3d::contour_from / flat_from doors: Inside cuts the
innermost offset pass first, Auto and Outside keep today's outside-in
order move for move. The other patterns keep their moves and stamp and
the row names the pattern as not using the value. Geodesic is a
follow-up (#3624).

Fixes #3362

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
